    "Context records the disposition of the optional extension of _project/scripts/timing_policy_check.py to flag time.time() pairs used as durations: tracked as a new item with a reason, or not pursued with a reason (the checker currently reports 197 informational 'unknown' findings, so the signal is weak)."
